{"title": "Crushing Blows", "pageid": 28977, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Crushing_Blows", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Crushing Blows</b> is a passive feature that enhances the wearer's unarmed accuracy and damage.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>The wearer gains a +1 bonus to unarmed <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> and their unarmed attacks deal an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">2</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span></a> damage. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gloves_of_Crushing\" title=\"Gloves of Crushing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Gloves_Monk_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Monk_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Gloves_Monk_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Gloves_Monk_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Gloves_Monk_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Gloves_Monk_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Gloves_Monk_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Monk_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Gloves_Monk_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Gloves_of_Crushing\" title=\"Gloves of Crushing\">Gloves of Crushing</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Crushing Blows affects both melee unarmed strikes and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/30px-Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/40px-Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">Throw</a> attacks, but provides no extra damage on Throws.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Crushing Blows applies its <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack roll</a> bonus twice.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714194653\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.043 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.048 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1499/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 12165/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4241/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 937077/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.312      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   42.312      1 -total\n 29.29%   12.392      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 27.27%   11.537      3 Template:Icon_text\n 25.84%   10.931     17 Template:Trim\n 22.55%    9.540      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 20.63%    8.727      1 Template:Attack_Roll\n 19.83%    8.391      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n 19.11%    8.084      5 Template:Ifempty\n 12.88%   